{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\c1\\c17f3ef6c7ac5e8b646df14649c0a3d3ee08971c0d8035cb1251dac9977bae99.wav","fid":"e2793e3afe8341764cde79b2c82ed2ba7b1ea641fac371563c30e84589af7652","text":"我只是突然想到，现在我已经能被别人看见了，那……我岂不是可以参加自己的歌友会了。"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\6a\\6a0be61a90592a16062632ea07baaace92f96e2389d5fb3c0b6b8501edadbf8d.wav","fid":"e71469b7097f0af525892a0bb320d4826d5b76623eaab77018cca8b16c5fa27f","text":"接下来的路，我们顺着那光走就好了~"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\4c\\4cee2a233b5d4d26b13c58c212a85e30ef8845bc342d54f84b9d31b2a0c08553.wav","fid":"e7c82c7cd3a3ede17f6f8e3ed43e066a7f5ed6fe3fb30d6de2dfcdb9e54cd62e","text":"……孤身在虚质里泡了那么久，就算有白鸟护航，对身体的损害肯定也不小。"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\ad\\ad4b1195907d253d7a10e03f5c6472d83e6830e005ebf6956e39d950060b4658.wav","fid":"e7f631d75a6a4758916d314100aa83918ceb30241387cbdf035f5e7c67994dc5","text":"嗯~这张纪念海报做得还挺好看的。"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\c9\\c9c831e01c2fc0b6811cb0b0777346edd58abcc781ddfa56f804f7e5fc66496d.wav","fid":"eb0b383a466ce4d9e122df2748292fda219d77583a81ba8c949f1d284c10e37b","text":"以前你穿着这身在学院里行动时，总是会有一大~群人被你迷倒呢，索拉里斯的救、世、主。"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\06\\06288e2347cd34f6061729ba362b3115650bb6d6762ee89496083e28f7cfc283.wav","fid":"ec1283a3be488fedbb5bc125bfbd4fac113443b00c6c358306da0007a4fc3593","text":"是。很厉害吧？我让它醒过来了一瞬呢！"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\b5\\b5605ec255051741b1ea9e44211a981184884bc82afa4d5aa93ad7f9bdf9b7ff.wav","fid":"ec1bcb5f03f7d56d9fc540964c0cc38224deff5af07caf8979be4914a5fc5b3b","text":"哈，工作狂。我就知道你会这么说。"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\31\\3195d9a38ee96129944fc21f951fb0c756213e29e13df376a6d48bafcfd759c8.wav","fid":"ee9abdc6cfbc2a82d8631b16e63131ea82b98433c38feb5f1b260cb1d6473328","text":"就这样，猫一直握着它的剑，不停地战斗，不停地说话，不停地奔波……"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\ab\\abde2a9f365d644c98de05ce6d4672056da846a85942e74bbd0b46225dbe77b2.wav","fid":"eeaaa49279f89ddbcb1ede61928b3f9c26d8b14531ceddc65c2a03f6663862df","text":"啊~只是我的个人习惯。和大家打招呼，说话，听课，参加社团活动——感觉就像自己还活着。"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\e2\\e23d0a08060b5dc9ba7155547e4abd03c19eee9abd467c46a81a8218e74ca5e7.wav","fid":"eee942131fb2ef92bfa92a342037fe4ce5654306d4b5bea39cd9c3de5138b07f","text":"如果不这样做，就容易忘掉身为人类的立场。这算是一种……自我提醒。"}
{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\00\\00787de2eeba5543d79231b4bf2ad381758804e1d32c10ddfd422e5b613d7104.wav","fid":"f03ae750730a4b37103ec5ae3dacd6a1819d0b501a6c4482bba1f3deaec790b5","text":"喏，你去坐那个位置，我以前听教授演讲偷睡时辨认过，那里视野最好。"}
