{"audio":"E:\\project\\dotstts\\data\\work\\standardized\\aa\\aabfc9ae07ef5e81592c5acb84a1be6a696a68fe0a7bb0086b3083b99ca028e2.wav","fid":"f67eb5c3dcc781da079bd1bb3fa1eeb0617f9237f30a92db26abb329e90bfd61","text":"但猫并不知道这点，当它睁开金色的眼睛时，就落到了一个小小的纸盒里。"}
